Laziness analysis guard (zero-delta fetches/actions plus analysis budget).

Matrix: 10 single-foundation adopt-* consumers (adopt-polyglot out,
multi-foundation; cc/java negative-only, same rule as slices 3/4).

M1 configured targets (cquery deps --output=label | sort -u | wc -l) equals pin, delta 0.
M2 actions (aquery --output=text | grep -c ActionKey:) equals pin plus forbidden-marker absence.
M3 fetch set (cquery repo prefixes, Bzlmod portable equivalent of the resolved file) subset of allowlist plus isolated-cache spot check.
M4 analysis time (build --nobuild --profile runAnalysisPhase) within budget; counts hard fail, time rerun-legitimate per ADR 0022.

Seed-only, warm cache, budget under 5 minutes. No new job; runs in dogfood-freshness after examples_laziness_runtime, before quality_cache_aquery.
